      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "**Please do not start taking St. John's Wort while on warfarin without first consulting your doctor.** St. John's Wort can significantly interact with warfarin, potentially affecting how your body metabolizes the medication and leading to dangerous changes in your blood clotting levels. Because of these serious risks, always discuss supplements with your healthcare provider before combining them with prescription blood thinners.",
