      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Even a small dose of St. John's Wort can still cause a significant and unpredictable interaction with warfarin. Dosages don't always equate to small impacts when enzyme induction is involved, and even minor changes can dangerously alter your INR levels. Because this risk can lead to serious medical events like clots or bleeding, there is no safe \"small dose\" to start with without medical clearance. Please reach out to a pharmacist today for immediate, expert guidance regarding your specific medication regimen.",
